{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765030/extras/c302217acfc2b2ef51f28b3537e118aa.poster.avif?t=1756129550\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765030/extras/c302217acfc2b2ef51f28b3537e118aa.webm?t=1756129550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765030/extras/c302217acfc2b2ef51f28b3537e118aa.mp4?t=1756129550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>You\u2019ve spent your whole life moving through normal space.</strong> <br><strong>This game teaches you what happens when it\u2019s no longer normal.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765030/extras/058d0b547cd6df70a98c515e1eb3cd85.poster.avif?t=1756129550\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765030/extras/058d0b547cd6df70a98c515e1eb3cd85.webm?t=1756129550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765030/extras/058d0b547cd6df70a98c515e1eb3cd85.mp4?t=1756129550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Sophie in the Tangled World is a quiet, story-driven puzzle adventure. The story follows a girl from early-19th-century Paris who slips into a strange, parallel version of her city, where the rules of familiar space no longer apply \u2014 and the only way back is to master the logic of this impossible geometry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765030/extras/b127e214c56d4841d506afb2ead2e541.poster.avif?t=1756129550\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765030/extras/b127e214c56d4841d506afb2ead2e541.webm?t=1756129550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765030/extras/b127e214c56d4841d506afb2ead2e541.mp4?t=1756129550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>What Awaits You</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Topological Puzzles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a single step and reappear in the room\u2019s far corner. Watch, experiment, and deduce the hidden laws of non-Euclidean space.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Silence Instead of Tutorials</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every rule you master is one you uncover yourself. No pop-ups, no glowing arrows \u2014 only time to think and the thrill of a genuine \u201caha!\u201d moment. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-Crafted Atmosphere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each scene is filled with with period detail, while a minimalist original ambient score creates a calm, reflective mood that lets every discovery resonate.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3765030?t=1756129550","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3765030?t=1756129550","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765030/8fafad3649fd9567eafcb56d0cec9f4de450744b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756129550","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765030/8fafad3649fd9567eafcb56d0cec9f4de450744b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756129550","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descri